#the mod name as displayed in-game
displayName: "Project Farstar (Cryon)"

#the internal name of your mod
name: "cryon"
#Changing this ID may cause an error.
#your name
author: "Bowen-H0"

#the fully qualified main class of the mod
main: "cryon.CryonJavaMod"

#the mod description as seen in the mod dialog

description: '''
[#7ec8e3]Project Farstar[] (formerly [#7ec8e3]Cryon Mod[]) is an expansion that takes you to brand new planets.

The first planet, [#7ec8e3]Cryon[], is a frozen world. You can carry resources to other sectors, just like in [accent]Serpulo[].

Over [accent]100+[] new pieces of content! Including new ores, new machines, and new units.

[accent]Development progress:[]
- [#7ec8e3]Cryon[]: main campaign is [accent]complete[], and more content is still in development.
- [accent]Aravis[]: new planet, [accent]in development[].


[accent]Thanks for playing this mod!
Feel free to report issues or suggest ideas: [lightgray]github bowen-H0[]

Supported languages: [cyan]English[] / [cyan]中文[]

[accent]Note:[] This mod was renamed from "Cryon Mod" to "Project Farstar". Your saves are safe.

[#7ec8e3]远星计划[]（原名 [#7ec8e3]Cryon Mod[]）是一个带你前往全新星球的拓展模组。

第一颗星球 [#7ec8e3]Cryon[] 是一个冰封世界。和 [accent]塞普罗[] 一样,你可以把资源带到其他区块。

超过 [accent]100+[] 种全新内容!包括新的矿石、新的机器和新的单位。

[accent]开发进度:[]
- [#7ec8e3]Cryon[]:主线战役[accent]已完成[],更多内容仍在开发中。
- [accent]Aravis[]:全新星球,[accent]开发中[]。


[accent]感谢你游玩本模组!
欢迎反馈问题或提出建议:[lightgray]github bowen-H0[]

支持语言:[cyan]English[] / [cyan]中文[]

[accent]注意:[]本模组已从 "Cryon Mod" 更名为 "Project Farstar"。你的存档不会受到影响。


Contributors:
LSK133
Gary

'''
#the mod version
version: 24.1.0
#the minimum game build required to run this mod
minGameVersion: 160

#this is a java mod
java: true

#mods required for this mod to work
dependencies: []